data/ud/
# Quarto paper build artifacts. The generated TeX is disposable; the rendered paper, the ACL
# extension and the exported figures are tracked.
paper/*.pdf
!paper/fig-training.pdf
!paper/fig-measurement.pdf
!paper/fig-grid.pdf
!paper/fig-projection.pdf
